| `transports.enabled` | list of strings | `["rest", "mcp"]` plus the copier answer `transports` | keys of `transports.available`: a closed set | check_H; the showcase; `scripts/check_venv.py`; `tests/optional_deps.py` | An entry not in `transports.available`, or whose directory is missing, is an error. An entry with a `transports.extras` entry makes that extra judged by `make check-venv` and its tests fail rather than skip on a missing import. | adding a transport: it needs a directory and an `available` entry first | always |
